<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI52-QA3-WINDOWS-POSIXPATH-TEST-CRASH>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI52-QA3-WINDOWS-POSIXPATH-TEST-CRASH" ;
  triage:title "test_main_allows_windows_tcp_without_a_comparison_reference crashes on real Windows CI (PosixPath cannot be instantiated)" ;
  triage:description "scripts/smoke/test_run_admission_capacity.py:323-359 (test_main_allows_windows_tcp_without_a_comparison_reference), added/relied upon as part of the AI52-QA2-ARCH-001-COMPARISON-HARDFAIL fix, does `mock.patch.object(RUNNER, 'Path', PosixPath)` to simulate posix-style path semantics while also mocking os.name to 'nt'. On real Windows CI runners (Python 3.14.6), instantiating pathlib.PosixPath directly raises pathlib.UnsupportedOperation: cannot instantiate 'PosixPath' on your system (Python 3.14 hardened this restriction). This crashes argparse's --atm-home type=Path conversion inside RUNNER.main(), failing both 'Test (windows-latest)' and 'Just lint (windows-latest)' jobs on PR #719 at commit 84b9727e with exit code 1. This is a genuine, deterministic regression (reproduced identically in both CI jobs), not a flake -- confirmed via gh run view 30723594022 logs for jobs 91431338682 and 91431260033." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:category "ci" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-08-02T00:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AI-52 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-08-02T00:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-08-02T01:10:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:progressNote "Discovered during AI52-QA-3 CI verification of commit 84b9727e (the AI52-QA2-ARCH2-001-COMPARISON-HARDFAIL fix round). gh pr checks 719 showed Test (windows-latest) and Just lint (windows-latest) both failing with pathlib.UnsupportedOperation: cannot instantiate 'PosixPath' on your system, traced to test_run_admission_capacity.py:342 mock.patch.object(RUNNER, 'Path', PosixPath). AI52-QA-4 (commit c46590cb): fixed by swapping to PureWindowsPath (a host-agnostic pure-path class). req-qa independently confirmed no real filesystem operation is ever attempted against the mocked Path object in this test (matching_profile_reference and run_capacity are both separately mocked; the only use is a lexical '/' join at run_admission_capacity.py:953), no remaining concrete PosixPath/WindowsPath instantiations anywhere in the repo, and test coverage intent preserved (comparison_required False, comparison_median None still asserted). CI reconfirmed green on all 8 legs including Test (windows-latest) and Just lint (windows-latest) at c46590cb (gh pr checks 719). Confirmed fixed." ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI52-QA3-WINDOWS-POSIXPATH-TEST-CRASH/test-file> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" .

